node server/welcome/ui_test.js || exit 1
node server/welcome/catalogue_test.js || exit 1
# THE VIDEO LAB's parity gate and its arithmetic. The gate runs the usual
# two-directional census in BOTH surfaces (an action a person cannot reach and
# an action an agent cannot reach are both failures here — the first run found
# one of each), plus this surface's own promise: the toggles, the comparison
# arms and the size guidance are DATA, so no knob id, no arm id and no
# resolution may be a literal in web/videolab.js, and every `cite` must name a
# file that is actually in the repository. The second test pins the one claim
# everything else rests on: that the commit-sigma arithmetic the panel shows
# reproduces docs/H3_REFERENCE_BLEED.md's own table (0.800 / 0.632 / 0.387 /
